WEBVTT

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:00.690
I saw this weird vending machine...

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:01.900
Vending machine?

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:04.110
It was just sitting out
at a shut-down love hotel,

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:06.110
and I've never seen that brand before.

00:02:06.110 --> 00:02:07.610
That is weird.

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:09.320
And you can't buy anything.

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:13.030
The thing was on so I tried putting
some money in, but it came back.

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:13.900
"Weekly Training Schedule"
"Win the National Tournament"

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:14.730
And it had this weird logo, too.

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:17.320
Shut up, first-years!

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:21.940
She's so scary!

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:28.730
Did you hear? Hikawa isn't going
to qualify for the national tournament.

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:33.070
Oh, wow. Didn't she get accepted
into this school as an athlete?

00:02:58.150 --> 00:02:59.730
Piece of shit.

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:08.980
Thank you for finding one of my precious coins.

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:11.570
Please allow me to return the favor.

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:17.150
Get set!

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:23.320
I feel so light! So strong!

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:24.730
Faster!

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:27.690
With these legs, I can go anywhere!

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:30.480
Those little punks can't touch me!

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:34.860
That's it! Faster! Faster!

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:49.360
What the...? What is this?!

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:52.570
Damn it! Where are they?!

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:55.400
I still can't find a single one!

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:02.730
Shit!

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:07.860
By the way, Shuichi. Do you know what this is?

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:11.280
No, I've never seen it. Is it a coin?

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:15.440
It seems to be related
to you monsters somehow...

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:16.650
"You monsters"?

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:18.780
If you don't know, that's fine.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:20.900
Hang on a sec!

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:40.110
Pathetic!

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:42.230
Come on!

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:46.230
I was only planning
to steal the coin from you, but...

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:49.860
Seeing my face is a problem.
I guess I'll kill you.

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:51.110
Die!

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:54.360
Excuse me.

00:04:58.030 --> 00:05:00.360
Shuichi, do it! Now!

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.110
What?!

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:04.110
You bitch! I'll kill you!

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:06.980
What are you doing?! Get rid of her!

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:12.730
Shuichi!

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:16.610
What are you running away for! Fight!

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:24.230
That bitch!

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:27.780
I'll kill her!

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:34.730
You idiot. Why'd you run away?

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:37.110
She was defenseless.

00:05:37.110 --> 00:05:41.570
H-How'd you know she was an enemy?

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.860
Did you hit your head or something?

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:46.480
I didn't know if she was a monster or a thief,

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:49.980
but if someone shows up barefoot
on your balcony, they're an enemy!

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:52.900
You know what I mean!
You had the pepper spray ready!

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:55.780
You knew something might happen, didn't you?

00:05:55.780 --> 00:06:00.150
You were talking about the coin, too!
Something about power?!

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:02.570
Oh, you were listening?

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:05.440
You looked to me like you
were about to pass out.

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:08.690
What is that coin? Where did you get it?

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:13.230
We've got a bigger problem.
That girl wants to kill us.

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:18.650
We saw her face.
She'll probably come to silence us.

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:23.860
You wouldn't like it either, having
someone else know you're a monster.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.480
Well...

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:29.650
That girl seemed used to this kind of thing.

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:33.570
Not only has she seen our faces,
she knows where I live.

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:36.400
Yeah, but killing her...?

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:39.400
Call it a prediction.

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:42.360
But what I can say is that given the situation,

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:45.360
it's up to the two of us
to do something about it.

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:47.030
Do something?

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:49.610
Hmm...

00:06:49.610 --> 00:06:52.150
You've got a zipper on your back, don't you?

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:55.110
You didn't know?

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:58.570
Seriously, what am I? This is really--

00:06:58.570 --> 00:07:03.150
Hey, Shuichi. This coin means something, right?

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:06.070
Maybe the form you take means something, too.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:09.860
This form's... meaning?

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.570
Don't you want to know what you are?

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:16.900
You should find out what's
inside the zipper, don't you think?

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:19.360
Clair, are you serious?

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:21.280
It's like she said...

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:25.980
With that coin, "in exchange
for power, you lose everything."

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:29.980
It might be inside of you.

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:33.280
Something unknown to you--your true power.

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:35.820
My true power?

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:38.030
Don't you think it's absurd?

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:42.780
For you to have that silly
form for absolutely no reason.

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:47.400
Is it true? Do I really have
some kind of great power?

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:51.780
Okay? I'm going to open it.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.570
It must mean something.

00:07:58.110 --> 00:08:00.030
Huh?

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:04.190
What? What's in there?

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:12.190
Nothing. There's nothing in there.
Not even a sign of you.

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:15.570
You're empty.

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:17.070
Empty?

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:18.690
Yeah.

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:21.400
Forget it, that girl is--

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.940
I don't care!

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.940
What do you mean?!

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:28.480
If we don't do something
about her, we'll be killed!

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:32.030
I don't care anymore.

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:35.690
I have nothing.

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:37.320
I'm empty.

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:42.690
A costume... So that's it!

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:45.230
I think I know what it means.

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:47.690
Shuichi, do you mind if I go inside?

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:48.820
What?!

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:50.860
It's worth giving it a try.

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:52.610
What are you talking about?!

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:55.820
Enter the emptiness, and become one.

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:57.690
That must be what the emptiness means.

00:08:57.690 --> 00:09:00.070
I don't think so!

00:09:00.070 --> 00:09:04.480
Please. I feel like this will make us one.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:07.480
Okay.

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:17.860
It's so sticky.

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:20.150
I'm not going to get digested
or something, am I?

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:23.070
I don't know, I can't see it.

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:25.570
Are you ready? I'm going in.

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:27.820
Uh, okay.

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:35.030
Wow, it's so sticky and moist.

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:36.980
Wait, be gentle!

00:09:36.980 --> 00:09:40.780
Just relax. Here I go.

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:45.780
I'm going all the way in.

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:57.110
It's so warm and fits just right.

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:59.860
D-Does it hurt?

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:05.440
N-No. You... You're inside of me.

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:08.610
Yes. We are one now.

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:11.230
And... I feel it.

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:12.940
What?

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:15.860
Your hatred...

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:18.360
Your sadness...

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:20.070
I don't have those things.

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:23.030
I can feel it! I feel your heart!

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:26.860
Shuichi! Are you okay?

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:31.530
What happened to you? Something terrible?

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.320
What should I do?

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:40.190
It's fine. You don't have to do anything.

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:43.030
It's okay, just calm yourself.

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:44.780
Mmm.

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:50.400
I can sense your feelings, too.
Anger, anxiety...

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:54.730
But you haven't yet realized how strong you are.

00:10:54.730 --> 00:11:01.030
I will use that strength. How does that sound?

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:03.070
Okay.

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:05.900
Let's defeat her, together.

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:13.400
Found you!

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:21.730
I'm tired of chasing you shitheads!
Where's the bitch?!

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:29.150
Don't fuck with me!

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:38.690
Is that all you got?!

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:45.780
What's wrong, you little shit?
Where's the bitch?!

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:48.530
Where is she?! Tell me!

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:49.690
Are you okay?

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:54.230
Let me handle moving. You focus
on channeling your strength to me.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:56.480
G-Got it!

00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:59.480
I'm not used to controlling you yet!

00:12:06.900 --> 00:12:09.030
Come on! Come on!

00:12:09.530 --> 00:12:15.070
You little shit!
Trying to pull me down with you?!

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:27.900
You're just jealous of me!

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:32.150
You have no talent!

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:37.480
Run off and play with the other babies!

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:40.320
You're so weak! You little insect!

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:45.070
Ready to die, little shit?!

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:55.400
Clair...?

00:12:56.690 --> 00:12:59.150
Shut up!

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:05.650
It's okay. I will protect you.

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:10.530
Hurry up and die!

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:22.150
C-Clair...?

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:24.440
I think I've got the hang of it.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:28.070
I had trouble at first, but now...

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:30.190
Let's go, Shuichi!

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:32.230
You...!

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:50.860
Hang on, Clair!

00:13:58.030 --> 00:14:01.190
That's it. Like a glove!

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:10.610
Pain.

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:14.650
The ugly sensation of hitting someone.

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:20.230
But I couldn't stop Clair.

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:23.860
Agency over my body
had been taken away.

00:14:25.230 --> 00:14:26.900
Completely.

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:32.610
You think you're tough, shithead?!

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:42.190
I'll ask you again. And if you
don't answer, I'll snap your leg.

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:45.860
That voice. You're...

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:49.070
How do you use the coins?

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:53.150
Do you give it to someone?
Or take it somewhere?

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:57.030
You think I'm going to answer you, bitch?

00:14:57.030 --> 00:14:59.110
Oh, well. Too bad.

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:00.230
Clair, wait!

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:06.110
Probably should have
been nice and answered, huh?

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:15.610
No. This isn't real.

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:20.400
There's no way I could do this!

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:29.610
I can run. I can still run!

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:35.280
I'm not going to die here!

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:41.900
Sorry. I'm not quite ready to die, either.

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:43.980
Clair, stop!

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:46.900
Clair!

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:55.110
This is a bad dream...

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:04.230
Yeah. The absolute worst nightmare.

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:10.280
It's over. Hey, so actually...

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:14.530
...I kind of pissed myself
while I was inside you.

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:21.400
That was a joke.

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:29.070
A week has passed since that night.
And my routine...

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:34.650
...hasn't changed at all.

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:39.360
Every day I go to school like always,
chat with my friends like always...

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:42.480
It's as if nothing ever happened.

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:44.810
"Clair"

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:45.150
She's in my contacts? When did she do that?!

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:46.730
What's wrong?

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:48.280
Ooh, did you get a girlfriend?

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:51.940
No! I just don't recognize
the number. It surprised me.

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:53.690
Why don't you answer?

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:55.610
Don't ignore me.

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:06.400
You don't need to come to my classroom.

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:09.320
It's your fault for not picking up.

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:13.320
But the fact that nothing
has happened in the past week

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:18.110
means that nobody found out who we are, right?

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:21.480
That was a crazy experience, though.

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:26.940
When I went inside you...
The sensation of melding with the costume...

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:30.860
The power rising up inside...
The incredible sense of smell...

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:33.230
The pain of being hit...

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:36.900
And sensing your feelings
as though they were mine...

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:42.360
It felt absolutely amazing! How was it for you?

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:48.570
It doesn't bother you?! You killed someone!

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:53.690
I killed her. It's not
your responsibility at all.

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:56.610
Still, it was a legitimate act of self-defense.

00:17:57.360 --> 00:18:01.190
Forget it. I don't want anything
to do with you anymore.

00:18:01.190 --> 00:18:03.900
If you want to reveal my identity, go ahead.

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:07.360
If you do, I'll tell people what you did.

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:10.530
Can you fight? All by yourself.

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:14.400
There must be more of you. More monsters.

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:17.440
What will you do if another one comes after you?

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:19.690
Can you defend yourself?

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:26.030
It's true. If she hadn't been there,
I would have been killed.

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:30.610
You can't do it. You're too kind.

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:35.650
And I can't defeat a monster
like that with my skinny little arms.

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:39.650
But if the two of us join forces...

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:43.280
...we can take on anyone.

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:49.940
I'm scared. I don't know what's going on.

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:56.150
I don't know how I got like this
or what's going to happen...

00:18:56.150 --> 00:19:00.610
If this is some kind of illness,
could I just drop dead?

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:05.780
What if I transform and can't go back?
How will I live?

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:13.030
I didn't know. You're terrified of transforming,

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:15.650
but you still saved me.

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:19.530
You are strong.

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:23.780
To tell the truth,
I don't know why you transform

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:28.690
or whether or not this coin is involved.

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:33.900
Elena... Is that you?

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:35.480
Yes.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:39.730
So, I can't guarantee you won't die

00:19:39.730 --> 00:19:45.110
or keep what you fear from happening.

00:19:45.110 --> 00:19:50.400
And things will probably
only get worse from here.

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:53.570
That's why there's one thing I will promise you.

00:19:53.570 --> 00:19:55.690
It doesn't matter why...

00:19:55.690 --> 00:20:02.030
But if something happens to you,
I'll die with you.

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:05.570
So even if you die, you won't be alone.

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:08.980
We two are one.

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:15.320
What if I say I want to die now?

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.190
All right...

00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:36.570
Shuichi... I'll be waiting for you!

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:56.730
Too bad. So close to letting it all go.

00:20:56.730 --> 00:21:01.110
What the hell are you thinking?

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:04.690
To tell the truth,
I'm looking for my older sister.

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:09.480
Long story short--she's a monster, like you.

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:14.360
Take this for me, Clair.

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:17.110
So... Where is she?

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:20.780
She disappeared.
After killing my mother and father.

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:22.110
What?!

00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:26.530
My sister's crime, these monsters...

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:30.230
This town is a real mess.

00:21:30.230 --> 00:21:34.820
We were brought together by destiny.

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:42.150
"Hotel Mythos"

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:42.150
"Half a year earlier"

00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:46.730
Please, help me find my coins.

00:21:46.730 --> 00:21:50.570
As thanks, I will grant any wish you have.

00:21:50.570 --> 00:21:56.150
So, can I use my wish on someone else?

00:21:56.150 --> 00:22:01.900
Huh? Hmm... I think I can handle that,
but are you sure it's okay?

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:04.690
Forcing your wish on someone else like that.

00:22:04.690 --> 00:22:06.320
The truth is...

00:22:08.690 --> 00:22:11.530
There's someone I want to be with!

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:46.940
"Episode 3: Elena"
